  "description": "European TRUCK Simulator\nStart your journey as a professional truck driver and explore the vast road networks of Europe! In European TRUCK Simulator, you will transport cargo between cities, complete delivery contracts, and experience the life of a long-distance trucker in a detailed 3D world.\n\nTake control of powerful trucks, plan your routes, and drive across highways, countryside roads, and busy urban areas. Complete transport missions, deliver cargo safely, and earn rewards to improve your trucking career. Manage your deliveries carefully, maintain efficiency, and build your reputation as a reliable driver.\n\nAs you progress, unlock new trucks, upgrade your vehicles, and expand your fleet to take on bigger and more profitable jobs. Improve your trucks’ performance and customize them to match your driving style.\n\nWhether you enjoy simulation games or relaxing driving experiences, European TRUCK Simulator offers immersive gameplay where you can travel across Europe and build your own trucking success story.\n\nFeatures:\n\n• Drive powerful trucks across European roads\n• Deliver cargo and complete transport missions\n• Earn rewards and upgrade your trucks\n• Unlock new vehicles and expand your fleet\n• Change between day and night driving\n• Experience different weather conditions, including rain\n• Enjoy a relaxing and immersive driving experience\n\nAre you ready to start your trucking career and conquer the roads of Europe?",
